Repository Overview: jev-code

1. Project Purpose & Domain
---------------------------
`jev-code` (package `jev-code`, v0.2.0, ESM/TypeScript) is a decision-driven programming toolkit built around "Jev," a decision-only model served by typesafe.ai. Unlike text-generating coding assistants, Jev never emits free-form prose or code strings: it selects one option from a bounded list, returns a probability for a statement, or scores input against a rubric. The repository's central thes
